  abilityDesc: 14 combo powerful Earth attack on all foes, greatly boosts max HP,
    hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts critical hit rate
    for 3 turns, enormously boosts Atk, Def, Rec relative to max HP for 3 turns,
    greatly boosts BC, HC drop rates for 3 turns & probability of purging turn skip
    effect from all allies
